window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I'm going to war with the bullies that have tormented me at the academy. It's time to make Jensen McCauley and his minions pay. </p> <p>But when our prank war lands us both on restriction, the two of us are trapped together. </p> <p>It's all his fault. It's all his plan. </p> <p>Jensen wanted to be left alone so he could unravel the secrets surrounding his sister's death. </p> <p>I've got enough to figure out. I have to make sense of the on-again, off-again heat between Lex and me, my hopeless crush on Rafe, the sexy instructor who think I'm a human trainwreck, and the way I've ruined my friendship with Penn. </p> <p>Plus, there's the small matter of the demon stalking me....</p> <p>But when Jensen McCauley needs my help...even though he doesn't deserve me....I'll help him find the truth about his sister. </p> <p>It's a truth some people are desperate to cover up. </p> <p>Can Jensen and I not only work together...but survive?</p>"; 
